### Get access token for courier1
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/keepdishesgoing/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=keepdishesgoing&client_secret=GXg3zjaA8qrRFWFU06yhLrvLVI877xYE&username={{courier1username}}&password={{courier1password}}&grant_type=password&scope=openid

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token_courier1", response.body.access_token);
%}

### Get access token for courier2
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/keepdishesgoing/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=keepdishesgoing&client_secret=GXg3zjaA8qrRFWFU06yhLrvLVI877xYE&username={{courier2username}}&password={{courier2password}}&grant_type=password&scope=openid

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token_courier2", response.body.access_token);
%}

### GET request for all unclaimed deliveries
GET http://localhost:8082/api/deliveries/unclaimed
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}

### Get request for single delivery
GET http://localhost:8082/api/deliveries/{{delivery5}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}

### GET request for courier 1
GET http://localhost:8082/api/couriers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}

### GET request for courier 2
GET http://localhost:8082/api/couriers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier2}}

### GET request with wrong token
GET http://localhost:8082/api/couriers
Authorization: Bearer WRONG.TOKEN

### GET request for courier 1 past deliveries
GET http://localhost:8082/api/couriers/completed
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}

### GET request for courier 2 past deliveries
GET http://localhost:8082/api/couriers/completed
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier2}}

### POST request to claim delivery as courier
POST http://localhost:8082/api/deliveries/{{delivery5}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}

### POST request to claim delivery as courier (Use it to try and claim a delivery when you already have one)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/deliveries/{{delivery6}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}

### POST request to claim an already claimed delivery
POST http://localhost:8082/api/deliveries/{{delivery1}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}

### POST request to unclaim your claimed delivery
POST http://localhost:8082/api/couriers/unclaim
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}

### POST request set delivery ready for pickup (Should only be preformed via order by restaurant)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/deliveries/{{delivery5}}/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}

### POST request set delivery as picked up and on the way (IN_DELIVERY)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/deliveries/{{delivery5}}/pickup
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}

### POST request set delivery as delivered and calculate the payout.
POST http://localhost:8082/api/deliveries/{{delivery5}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_courier1}}